8336", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036662_747067716361669_7222593589956048776_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rB_bu5oKJqUQ7kNvwG1tttH&_nc_oc=AdkNtgF4Pu09J3fTOz3CXV-8L5ANZlovyD44Lhqsa6mhITdhsOgX9_9qqGKLjkBVAR8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afx5C1omzPUxNCr8rSD_l7FpgTeBkJz3bR_X5g_A6xlJzw&oe=69AAB370"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot2.png", "id": "394388572770642", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75363518_394388576103975_7026843508908099590_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yJ6Gv7uyOdgQ7kNvwGjOM2r&_nc_oc=AdmZk8ast9FE0HrY-W_xKhaUJuEMWcrwO1EwmEY2EjPLVVbh-q0_aZfdT8UMOdP4d8U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxdIHSfcflGb2TJoytcIHL5s-2O4wyH9vEfLGKHRsWL3g&oe=69AACBBF"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot3.png", "id": "1458341788015477", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036698_1458341791348810_6442662506578395404_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iSMlkurtil8Q7kNvwFM25QN&_nc_oc=AdlBmipjvYfq1_7exOC7kCaewqFtes3wtxlUFj2RARRy5qYslZquNdWD737NoKfXmxQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afz2O9tdRETIS4njkk0cLqOBq65tLLUseMwdK8XxCTXNaA&oe=69AAB9A5"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot4.png", "id": "749337256127474", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031316_749337259460807_5096968805426332388_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yRTUFEYo4cIQ7kNvwH_bL_W&_nc_oc=AdmXw1Czmw4J2JW0kcCkIq_XqllwSM3yEWa3Xj2HspOFO03NQyjnYAVDU-D2tcrpPSE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afz34dVTtPSDpSLXhjKfgxe8iiYPY1R65KXx5yor9Scang&oe=69AAC579"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverLandscape.png", "id": "487236046744268", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75572754_487236050077601_8348865219296916010_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_VpTdJlRrY0Q7kNvwFbIOZr&_nc_oc=Admbmn_RmzzidQ2QcWbXxa4op3xUMYgZo-5XbsrJWGuho6OX5Bs7T7XUu1PQ3EpHQCE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afyen3XMGGOy2Bnwx5rlwKY_T7QM_C_uMhJQKz_Bx00HWA&oe=69AABC81"}, "display_name": "3D scan of a campus", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Move like a pedestrian in a campus, reconstructed from videos taken by a helmet-held 360 camera (Garmin Virb), whose trajectory is about 5.2km long.\n\nRight controller:\n- Rotate on the left or right by using the joystick\n- Update the vertical offset (up or down) by using the joystick\n- Choose a location and teleport to it by using the virtual laser pointer\n- Teleport by using the index trigger only if the laser is green (not red)\n\nLeft controller:\n- Move continuously by using the joystick\n- Switch pannel and map by using the grip/hand trigger\n- If both map and pannel are disabled, switch between rendering modes (texturing or normal colors) by pressing the index trigger\n- The map shows the cloud of mesh vertices and the user location\n- If the pannel is enabled, switch between constrained and unconstrained motions by pressing the index trigger\n- The constrained motion controls your height above the ground\n- The pannel shows information about the 3D model and the selected motion.\n", "short_description": "Move continuously like a pedestrian in a campus, which was computed by photogrammetry from two 2496x2496 videos taken by a helmet-held 360 camera (Garmin Virb) and by biking about 5.2km in the campus des C\u00e9zeaux (in Aubi\u00e8re, France)."}]}, "developer_name": "Maxime Lhuillier", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://maximelhuillier.fr/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Unity 2019.4", "support_website_url": "http://maxime.lhuillier.free.fr/", "website_url": "https://maximelhuillier.fr/", "category": "ENTERTAINMENT", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "726368